{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05262","headline":"奉和七夕两仪殿会宴应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和七夕两仪殿会宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青女三秋节，黄姑七日期。\n星桥度玉佩，云阁掩罗帷。\n河气通仙掖，天文入睿词。\n今宵望灵汉，应得见蛾眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}